==German==

===Etymology===
Perhaps from {{af|de|Amt|Simile}} (from {{der|de|la|simile|t=similar}}), the name of a standardized form used by the bureaucracy of the Austrian Empire. Alternatively, perhaps a reference to the service horses ({{af|de|Amt|t1=official|-s-|Schimmel|t3=white horse}}) which were provided in Switzerland and elsewhere to government officials.

